@startuml UC5_VisualizeSessionLog_Design
autonumber "<b>0:"
title [UC5] Visualize a session in the personal sessions log

' =======================================================
' COMPONENT DEFINITION
' =======================================================
actor "Registered User" as RU
participant "Mobile Application\n(Tier 1)" as Client
participant "BBP API Gateway\n(Tier 2)" as GW

box "BBP Application Server (Tier 3)" #LightBlue
    ' Usiamo PathManager perché gestisce le sessioni/corse
    participant "PathManager" as TM
end box

participant "BBP BikePath DB\n(Tier 4)" as DB

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over RU, Client: Entry Condition: RU selects "My recorded trips"

' =======================================================
' (a) SYSTEM SHOWS THE SESSIONS LOG
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: clickMyRecordedTrips()
activate Client

' Richiesta della lista (solo sommari, per efficienza)
note right of Client: Fetching lightweight list summary
Client -> GW: GET /api/users/me/sessions
activate GW

note right of GW: Routing to PathManager
GW -> TM: retrieveUserSessions(UserID)
deactivate GW
activate TM

' Query al DB per i sommari
TM -> DB: findSessionsByUserID(UserID)
activate DB
note right of DB: Returns: ID, Date, Distance, Duration
DB --> TM: List<SessionEntity>
deactivate DB

' Conversione in DTO
TM -> TM: convertToSummaryDTOs(List)

TM --> GW: 200 OK (List<SessionSummaryDTO>)
deactivate TM
activate GW
GW --> Client: 200 OK (List<SessionSummaryDTO>)
deactivate GW

' Visualizzazione Lista
Client --> RU: displaySessionLog(list_of_trips)

' =======================================================
' (b) RU FINDS AND SELECTS THE SESSION
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: selectSession(sessionID)

' =======================================================
' (c) THE SYSTEM SHOWS THE DETAILS
' =======================================================
note right of Client: Fetching full details (GPS points, Metrics)
Client -> GW: GET /api/sessions/{sessionID}
activate GW

GW -> TM: fetchSessionDetails(sessionID)
deactivate GW
activate TM

' Query al DB per i dettagli completi
TM -> DB: findFullSessionData(sessionID)
activate DB
note right of DB: Returns: Waypoints, Speed/Elev profiles, Meteo
DB --> TM: SessionFullEntity
deactivate DB

TM --> GW: 200 OK (SessionDetailDTO)
deactivate TM
activate GW
GW --> Client: 200 OK (SessionDetailDTO)
deactivate GW

' Rendering lato Client (Smart Client)
note right of Client: Client renders Map and Charts locally
Client -> Client: renderMapPath(GPS_Points)
Client -> Client: computeGraphs(Metrics)

Client --> RU: displaySessionDetails(data, map, metrics)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
RU -> Client: pressExit()
Client -> Client: clearDetailView()
Client --> RU: returnToMenu()
note over RU, Client: Exit Condition: RU closes the log page

deactivate Client
@enduml